{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^the huge, muscular black hound in a jacket in front of you is never sitting or resting. Always vigilant and regularly smocking, he move only to go talk to his wife either to bring her something or to accompagny her to the bathroom.","\n",["ev",{"^->":"0.2.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Hi, I'm the train conductor, what's your name?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":"0.2.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^He coughs a bit, look at you head to feet and back again, then answer. Name’s Yakiv Myronenko. Traveling with my wife, Irina. We’re… keeping to ourselves, if you don’t mind.","#","^speaker:Yakiv","/#","\n",{"->":"Yakiv1"},{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["done",{"#f":5}]}],"done",{"Yakiv1":[[["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv1.0.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^you look like someone who have seen some stuff, Yakiv.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv1.0.1.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^sorry for the disturbance, I just like to know who I'm traveling with.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv1.0.2.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-2","flg":18},{"s":["^•\tHow are you feeling ?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv1.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^We’ve all seen things, haven’t we, conductor? Some of us just choose not to remember them.","\n",{"->":"Yakiv1"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv1.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.1.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Likewise.","\n",{"->":"Yakiv1"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv1.0.c-2.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.2.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Can’t complain. Cough loudly.","\n","^he's clearly hurting because he's in a god damn bad mood. I'm fine. leave me alone.","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv1.0.c-2.11.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^of course",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv1.0.c-2.11.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^thank you.","\n","end","^he sitting down near Irina, smoking and coughing loudly. I'm not gonna lie, I'm in a pretty bad shape. Look at me. If anything happens to me, I want you to take care of Irina, ok?","\n",{"->":"Yakiv2"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"Yakiv2":[[["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv2.0.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^I'll do what I can.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv2.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^I will need more than that, conductor.","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv2.0.c-0.9.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^•\twhere are you from ?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv2.0.c-0.9.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Paruń, near the Green Sea forest. Quiet place before the SRUR came.","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv2.0.c-0.9.c-0.9.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^never been there. What does it look like?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv2.0.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^You know, like... trees, wooden houses and stuff.","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv2.0.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^... and stuff ?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv2.0.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Yeah. He smoke his cigarette.","\n",{"->":"YakivTaff"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"YakivTaff":[[["ev",{"^->":"YakivTaff.0.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^waht kind of work did you do there ?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"YakivTaff.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^I was a carpenter.","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"YakivTaff.0.c-0.9.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^what kind of carpentry work?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"YakivTaff.0.c-0.9.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Ah, well… small jobs mostly. Doors, tables… that sort of thing. He avoid eye contact.","\n","^Look, I’m not here to build furniture for anyone. Let's forget about the past, right?","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"YakivTaff.0.c-0.9.c-0.11.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^•\twhat's bringing you aboard my train ?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"YakivTaff.0.c-0.9.c-0.11.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Simple. Getting my wife to safety. That’s all that matters.","\n",{"->":"YakiveMotivation"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"YakiveMotivation":[[["ev",{"^->":"YakiveMotivation.0.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^I get it.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"YakiveMotivation.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^...","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"YakiveMotivation.0.c-0.9.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^something happened?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"YakiveMotivation.0.c-0.9.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^War happened, remember?","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"YakiveMotivation.0.c-0.9.c-0.9.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^true, true.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"YakiveMotivation.0.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^...","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"YakiveMotivation.0.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^sorry.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"YakiveMotivation.0.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^He brings his cigarette once again to his mouth and grunts.","\n",{"->":"Yakiv3"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"Yakiv3":[[["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv3.0.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^your from occupied territory since basically six years. Why the sudden need to leave and not before?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv3.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^You ask a lot of questions for a conductor. You got a reason to doubt a man protecting his wife?","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv3.0.c-0.9.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^I just find that weird, that's all.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv3.0.c-0.9.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Listen,  war eats everything and leave nothing behind. Even if you think your safe, it will eventually catch up to you. Doesn’t matter who you were. Soldier, worker, even a singer-  He catches himself briefly, then clear his throat.  Anyone.","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv3.0.c-0.9.c-0.9.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^do you have any family?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv3.0.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Just Irina now. The rest is… gone.","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv3.0.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^what happened?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"Yakiv3.0.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Never really had a family, bounced from foster home to foster home, until I was old enough to work. I made friends growing up working in events- he stop talking for a second ... like common workshop project. When the war came, most of us enroled. Not many survived.","\n",{"->":"YakivOrigin"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"YakivOrigin":[[["ev",{"^->":"YakivOrigin.0.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^your an orphan?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"YakivOrigin.0.1.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^you didn't joined the army?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"YakivOrigin.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Yes. He's looking at the smoke floating in front of him. I'm not a family man anyway. That's what makes me good at what I do.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"YakivOrigin.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.1.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Couldn't. I was taken by my job. As a carpenter, you know.","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"YakivOrigin.0.c-1.9.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^I never saw a man more devoted to his wife than you.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"YakivOrigin.0.c-1.9.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^She's strong. Stronger than me. And she has a heart of gold. Deserves better than all this.  He glances at her with warmth.","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"YakivOrigin.0.c-1.9.c-0.9.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^•\twhat will you do once in the neutral zone?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"YakivOrigin.0.c-1.9.c-0.9.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Find a roof. Keep Irina safe. Maybe… find work, if anyone needs a carpenter.","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"YakivOrigin.0.c-1.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Irina seems like a high standing woman.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"YakivOrigin.0.c-1.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Trust me she earned everything she got.","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"YakivOrigin.0.c-1.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^a simple life, for someone like you ? I find that hard to believe.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"YakivOrigin.0.c-1.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Believe what you want, conductor. We will find our peace.","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"YakivOrigin.0.c-1.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^•\tObserve.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"YakivOrigin.0.c-1.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^This dog is surrounded by smoke, and look around him with the eye of someone used to violence. He always positions himself between Irina and the other passengers. You think that at the slightest trigger, he could break anyone's face before anything could happen.","\n","end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}